        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header text-center mb-48">
      <span class="section-label">What We Do</span>
      <h2>Helping Buyers & Sellers Succeed</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="listings-grid-3" style="gap:24px;">
      <div class="info-card text-center">
        <div class="info-card-icon"><i class="fas fa-home"></i></div>
        <h3>Buying a Home</h3>
        <p>From first showing to closing day, Rajivan guides you through every step of the purchase process.</p>
        <a href="/home-search" class="btn btn-outline mt-16">Search Homes</a>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card text-center">
        <div class="info-card-icon"><i class="fas fa-tag"></i></div>
        <h3>Selling a Home</h3>
        <p>Get top dollar for your property with expert pricing strategy, marketing, and negotiation.</p>
        <a href="/home-valuation" class="btn btn-outline mt-16">Get Valuation</a>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card text-center">
        <div class="info-card-icon"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div>
        <h3>Let's Connect</h3>
        <p>Have questions? Ready to start your real estate journey? Reach out — Rajivan is here to help.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline mt-16">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="meet-grid">
      <div class="meet-photo">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?w=600&q=80" alt="Rajivan Varatharajah">
      </div>
      <div class="meet-content">
        <span class="section-label">About</span>
        <h2>Meet Rajivan</h2>
        <p>Rajivan Varatharajah is a dedicated real estate professional committed to helping clients navigate the buying and selling process with confidence. With years of experience in sales leadership and expert negotiation skills, Rajivan brings a strategic, client-focused approach to every transaction.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px;">Deeply rooted in the local community, he is passionate about service and actively gives back. Whether you're buying your first home, selling your property, or investing in real estate, Rajivan is ready to put his experience and dedication to work for you.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-primary">Learn More</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Let's Connect</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-cream">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header text-center mb-48">
      <span class="section-label">Explore My Portfolio</span>
      <h2>Featured Properties</h2>
    </div>
